{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2023-05-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'BEST BUY ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF BEST BUY CO., INC. (NYSE:BBY) HAS AUTHORIZED THE PAYMENT OF A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.92 PER COMMON SHARE. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JULY 6, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2023. THE COMPANY HAD 218,499,262 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK ISSUED AND OUTSTANDING AS OF APRIL 29, 2023.'}